@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
title PUT /api/workspace/v1/messenger/files/{file_uuid}
actor "客户端" as Client
participant "控制器 RestAlchemy" as API
database "配置文件存储器" as STORE
database "文件元数据 + ACL 在 PostgreSQL" as DB
queue "交易 outbox" as OUT
queue "delivery_snapshot_event\nexact file scope" as TASK
participant "沃克人游泳池" as WORKER
database "公众活动存储器" as EVENT
participant "控制器 WebSocket" as DISP
participant "签名客户端" as WS
Client -> API: PUT JSON 超级数据
API -> DB: BEGIN; 封锁所有者文件
API -> DB: 更新元数据
API -> STORE: 更新相关元数据
API -> OUT: 添加 file.updated
API -> DB: COMMIT
API --> Client: 200 JSON 超级数据
OUT -> TASK: immutable delivery_snapshot_event(outbox_event_uuid)
TASK -> WORKER: 拿起工作
WORKER -> EVENT: 插入已完成的 file.updated
DISP -> EVENT: 阅读/重复/播放
DISP -> WS: file.updated
@enduml
